267
00:21:36.588 --> 00:21:39.549
<i>One more song</i>
<i>Just one more</i>

268
00:21:39.633 --> 00:21:40.926
<i>Give us an encore</i>

269
00:21:41.009 --> 00:21:44.846
<i>Don't go away</i>
<i>We still have music to play</i>

270
00:21:45.847 --> 00:21:47.224
<i>Hey</i>
<i>I said</i>

271
00:21:47.307 --> 00:21:50.227
<i>One more song</i>
<i>Just one more</i>

272
00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:51.645
<i>All that I long for</i>

273
00:21:51.728 --> 00:21:54.481
<i>Give me a sign</i>
<i>It's not too late</i>

274
00:21:55.482 --> 00:21:58.402
<i>It's not too late</i>

275
00:21:59.403 --> 00:22:02.406
<i>One more song</i>
<i>One more song</i>

276
00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:07.869
<i>One more song</i>
<i>One more song</i>

277
00:22:10.122 --> 00:22:12.874
<i>One more song</i>
<i>One more song</i>

278
00:22:12.958 --> 00:22:16.336
<i>If you live on</i>
<i>It's through your music</i>

279
00:22:16.420 --> 00:22:18.255
<i>One more song</i>
<i>One more song</i>

280
00:22:18.338 --> 00:22:20.799
<i>A song for someone else to hear</i>

281
00:22:20.882 --> 00:22:22.884
<i>One more song</i>
<i>One more song</i>

282
